'''YETI''' was an unsigned [[:Category:South Korea|Korean]] Overwatch team. They competed in [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2024/Asia/Stage_1/Korea|OWCS 2024 Korea]] and [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2024/Asia/Stage_1/Main_Event|Asia]] Stage 1, then were acquired by [[Fnatic]] in June 2024 for the [[Esports_World_Cup/2024|Esports World Cup]].

